No, starting the chat will not display your Chat ID directly on the screen.

When you click Start, it simply opens the communication line and saves your ID on Telegram's servers. To actually see that hidden number, you have to use the browser trick:

    Go to your web browser and open: [https://api.telegram.org/botYOUR_BOT_TOKEN/getUpdates](https://api.telegram.org/botYOUR_BOT_TOKEN/getUpdates) (replace with your actual token).

    Look at the text on the screen to find "chat":{"id": followed by your numbers.

Alternatively, if that browser method sounds confusing, you can just search for @userinfobot in Telegram, open a chat with it, and it will immediately reply with your exact numeric ID.

